{"track":"r","category":"함수형 도구","level":4,"title":"함수를 인수로 받는 함수","desc":"<p><code>apply_twice(f, x)</code>를 만드세요. 함수 <code>f</code>를 <code>x</code>에 <b>두 번</b> 적용한 결과를 돌려줘요. 즉 <code>f(f(x))</code>.</p>","starter":"apply_twice <- function(f, x) {\n  \n}\n","solution":"apply_twice <- function(f, x) {\n  f(f(x))\n}\n","hint":"<p>R에서 함수는 값이에요. 인수로 받은 <code>f</code>를 그냥 <code>f(...)</code>처럼 부르면 돼요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"apply_twice(function(v) v + 3, 1)","expected":7,"visible":true},{"call":"apply_twice(sqrt, 16)","expected":2,"visible":true},{"call":"apply_twice(toupper, \"ab\")","expected":"AB","visible":false},{"call":"apply_twice(function(v) v * v, 3)","expected":81,"visible":false}],"id":"r-526"}